  // BOTH modes, which corrected PvE and broke regular. The PvE overrides are
  // kept as guards (see src/overrides/modes/pve/tasks.json5) and both true
  // values are recorded in src/divergences/tasks.json5 so a future flip in
  // either direction is detected instead of silently shipping wrong data.
